      "mergeID": "63c6d996725603760888d4fd",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The feature to hide your trust rank within vrchat has auto hidden my rank to user during world join or during conversations with another player without any user input to set my rank to user.\n\nThis has happened to other users and even friends in the lobby with me or without me.\n\nAsking or telling them about the rank change will bring attention to it; for that moment. After some time I notice that their rank changed to user, telling them that the rank was hidden back to user, and they tell me that they didn't change it to user.\n\nI have run into this bug myself, tried recreating steps for producing this bug consistently, and have come up empty handed.\n\nMy leads are upon joining the world and during conversations with others.\n\nSteps for recreating this bug consistently are unknown.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Rank gets auto hidden to user without user input",
