      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{620f973f5abcc7434a5ba50e|full_name}: A few things, actually! First of all, it seems like the bug is entirely local. If you set yourself to appear as a trusted user, all other users will see you as trusted and vice versa, even if the local user's MM says that they are appearing as 'User.'\n\nSecondly, it appears that on current live (as of June 20th, 2023) this repro for the bug no longer works. We have been doing a lot of cleanup regarding the profiles and menus in general, so this seems to have been fixed incidentally as part of one of those larger fixes. \n\nIf there are some edge cases we are still missing or some reproduction steps that are still working for you, let me know! We have plenty more menu cleanup still in the works as well, so it should get handled without too much delay.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
